          {
            "t": "The invention of the internet has completely revolutionized the way we communicate and access information. Before the internet, people relied heavily on traditional media such as daily newspapers, television broadcasts, and radio for the news. Researching a specific topic required physical trips to the library and hours of looking through heavy encyclopedias. Today, with just a few clicks, we can access a vast amount of information on almost any subject imaginable.",
